@api=http://localhost:3000/api

### get boards
GET {{api}}/boards?userId=1

# insert board testing
###
POST {{api}}/boards

{
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Test Book",
  "status": 0
}

### get a board
GET {{api}}/boards/1

### update board
PATCH {{api}}/boards/5

{
  "title": "PATCH Test Book",
  "userId": 1
}

###

PUT {{api}}/boards/6

{
  "title": "PUT Test Book",
  "userId": 1
}

### delete board
DELETE {{api}}/boards/7

