### get tasks
GET {{api}}/todos?boardId=2

# insert task testing
###
POST {{api}}/todos

{
  "title": "Test Todo",
  "detail": "Test Todo Detail",
  "boardId": 1
}

### get a task
GET {{api}}/todos/1

### update task
PATCH {{api}}/todos/5

{
  "title": "Test Todo PATCH",
  "detail": "Test Todo Detail",
  "boardId": 1
}

### update task

PUT {{api}}/todos/6

{
  "title": "Test Todo PUT",
  "detail": "Test Todo Detail",
  "boardId": 1
}

### delete task
DELETE {{api}}/todos/7